# Per-run outputs of the proposal tooling. Every one of these is rewritten by the next
# `final.mjs` / `supplied.mjs` run, and the copy that matters is the one placed beside the PDF in
# docs/proposals/. Committing them would mean a dirty tree after every render and a second, stale
# copy of each proposal's cells — the drift this repo already has a rule about.
#
# `results/` is NOT here and must not be: the annealer's candidates are committed on purpose —
# `final.mjs` is driven from them, so they are the searched proposals' record, not scratch.
*.html
proposal.json
proposal-import.txt
supplied.json
supplied-import.txt
